				Time="2011-08-02T10:52:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl1:xcenter ]追いつめられた
[Ctrl1:xcenter ][Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]王子……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-17T12:16:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
